2207:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ecp.c ****      * inversion (used for coordinate normalization) may leak the full value
2208:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ecp.c ****      * of its input via side-channels [2].
